      "title": "Dar es Salaam Historical Flood Extent",
      "description": "The dataset comprises of flood history (years of flood occurence), flood depth, reasons for flooding, types of buildings, uses, whether residents were evacuated or not. All data points were collected by using ODK Collect.. [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal resilienceacademy]",
